type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(aussprechen)</span> man dieses Wort aus?</div><div class=\"qko\">이 단어는 어떻게 발음해요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wie <b>spricht</b> man dieses Wort aus?</div>man의 동사는 er와 같은 모양이에요. sprechen은 e → i로 바뀌어요 — man spricht … aus.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Kinder haben Angst vor Spinnen. (어떤 아이들은)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Manche</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Manchen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Mancher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Manches</button></div><div class=\"qe\">복수 1격은 die → manche예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Ich habe geklingelt, aber <span class=\"qblank\"></span> hat aufgemacht. (아무도 문을 열지 않았어요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) niemand</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) nichts</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) alles</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) jemand</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사람이 '아무도 없다'는 niemand예요. nichts는 사물에 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;nichts&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Im Kühlschrank ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\">. Wir müssen einkaufen.</div><div class=\"qko\">냉장고에 아무것도 없어요. 장을 봐야 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"