=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(niemand)</span> erzählt.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 비밀은 아무에게도 말하지 않았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe das Geheimnis <b>niemandem</b> erzählt.</div>erzählen은 '누구에게'를 3격으로 받아요. niemand의 3격은 niemandem이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;einem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Bei dieser Hitze wird <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(man)</span> schnell schwindlig.</div><div class=\"qko\">이런 더위에는 금방 어지러워져요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Bei dieser Hitze wird <b>einem</b> schnell schwindlig.</div>'누구에게' 생기는 상태라서 3격이에요. man의 3격은 einem이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Wie findest du den Kuchen? — <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(지시대명사)</span> hat meine Oma gebacken.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 케이크 어때? — 그거 우리 할머니가 구우셨어.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wie findest du den Kuchen? — <b>Den</b> hat meine Oma gebacken.</div>den Kuchen을 대명사로 받았어요. 주어는 meine Oma이고 케이크는 목적어라서 4격 den이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;einer&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> In was für <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Firma · 여성)</span> Firma arbeitet deine Schwester? — In einem Start-up.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 언니는 어떤 회사에서 일해? — 스타트업에서.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · In was für <b>einer</b> Firma arbeitet deine Schwester? — In einem Start-up.</div>für가 아니라 in이 격을 정해요. in + 3격, 여성 → was für einer Firma.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Jeden Abend geht unser Nachbar mit dem Hund spazieren&quot;,&quot;Unser Nachbar geht jeden Abend mit dem Hund spazieren&quot;,&quot;Mit dem Hund geht unser Nachbar jeden Abend spazieren&quot;,&quot;Unser Nachbar geht mit dem Hund jeden Abend spazieren&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 이웃은 저녁마다 개를 데리고 산책해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">spazieren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">dem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Hund</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">unser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Nachbar</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Jeden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">geht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Abend</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">mit</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Jeden Abend geht unser Nachbar mit dem Hund spazieren.</b></div>jeden Abend는 4격 시간 표현이에요. 문장 앞에 오면 동사 geht가 바로 뒤에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Die Besitzerin <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Hauses wohnt in Spanien.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) dieses</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) diesem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) dieser</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) diesen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'이 집의'는 2격이에요. des Hauses → dieses Hauses.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Einer&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> von meinen Brüdern wohnt in Hamburg.</div><div class=\"qko\">제 형제 중 한 명은 함부르크에 살아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Einer</b> von meinen Brüdern wohnt in Hamburg.</div>명사 없이 '한 명'이라고 할 때 남성 1격은 einer예요. 동사도 단수 wohnt예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장을 고르세요.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Was für ein Wetter heute!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Solche Fragen hört man oft.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Jeder von uns hat eine Aufgabe.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Mit allen Teilnehmer habe ich gesprochen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">mit + 3격 복수라서 allen 다음 명사에도 -n이 붙어요 — mit allen Teilnehmern.<br>Was für ein …!은 감탄문으로도 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;einen&quot;],[&quot;keinen&quot;],[&quot;Der&quot;],[&quot;einen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> A: Ich brauche einen Regenschirm. Hast du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Regenschirm · 남성)</span>?<br>B: Leider nicht, ich habe selbst <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">. Aber frag Jonas. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(Jonas를 가리키는 지시대명사)</span> hat bestimmt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">A: 우산이 필요해. 하나 있어?<br>B: 아니, 나도 없어. 그런데 요나스한테 물어봐. 걔는 분명 하나 있을 거야.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · A: Ich brauche einen Regenschirm. Hast du <b>einen</b>?<br>B: Leider nicht, ich habe selbst <b>keinen</b>. Aber frag Jonas. <b>Der</b> hat bestimmt <b>einen</b>.</div>Regenschirm은 남성, haben의 목적어라서 4격 einen · keinen이에요.<br>Jonas를 der로 받고, der가 주어라서 1격이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;man&quot;],[&quot;man&quot;],[&quot;einen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Wenn <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> in Deutschland eine Wohnung sucht, braucht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> viel Geduld. Die Suche kostet <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(man)</span> viel Zeit.</div><div class=\"qko\">독일에서 집을 구하면 인내가 많이 필요해요. 집 찾기는 시간이 많이 들어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wenn <b>man</b> in Deutschland eine Wohnung sucht, braucht <b>man</b> viel Geduld. Die Suche kostet <b>einen</b> viel Zeit.</div>man은 man으로 이어 받아요. kosten은 사람을 4격으로 받아서 man의 4격 einen을 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;aller&quot;],[&quot;allen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Die Eltern <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(alle)</span> Schüler haben mit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(alle)</span> Lehrern gesprochen.</div><div class=\"qko\">모든 학생의 부모님이 모든 선생님과 이야기했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Eltern <b>aller</b> Schüler haben mit <b>allen</b> Lehrern gesprochen.</div>'모든 학생의'는 2격 복수 → aller(der Schüler처럼).<br>mit + 3격 복수 → allen Lehrern.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Von diesen Leuten kenne ich niemanden&quot;,&quot;Ich kenne von diesen Leuten niemanden&quot;,&quot;Niemanden kenne ich von diesen Leuten&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 사람들 중에 나는 아무도 몰라요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Leuten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">niemanden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Von</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">kenne</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">diesen</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Von diesen Leuten kenne ich niemanden.</b></div>von은 3격 전치사라서 diesen Leuten(복수 3격 -en, 명사 -n)이에요.<br>kennen의 목적어는 4격이라 niemanden이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 빈칸에 들어갈 수 없는 것은? — <span class=\"qblank\"></span> hat angerufen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Niemand</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Alle</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Jemand</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Einer</button></div><div class=\"qe\">hat은 단수 동사예요. alle는 '모든 사람'이라 복수라서 Alle haben angerufen이 돼요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"